  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_tacking_thread_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>thread for tacking, i.e. attaching pieces of cloth to one another with slight stitches which can be easily taken out (OED s.v. tack v.1 3a)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
